WEBVTT

00:12:58.397 --> 00:13:01.976
(Laughter)

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.245
If you want to talk to me
about ADHD afterwards,

00:13:04.269 --> 00:13:05.976
you can talk to me then.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.380
By the way, one last instruction,

00:13:08.404 --> 00:13:10.756
for my judges with the calculators --

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:11.922
you know who you are --

00:13:11.946 --> 00:13:16.976
there is at least a 50 percent chance
that I will make a mistake here.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:20.428
If I do, don't tell me
what the mistake is;

00:13:20.452 --> 00:13:22.784
just say, "you're close,"
or something like that,

00:13:22.808 --> 00:13:24.784
and I'll try and figure out the answer --

00:13:24.808 --> 00:13:26.976
which could be pretty
entertaining in itself.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.976
If, however, I am right,

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.976
whatever you do,
don't keep it to yourself, OK?